{
 "note": "改了哪里 → 建议跑哪些探针（测试分档第四节；ai-docs/20261110-test-tiers.md）。npm run test:changed 末尾按这张表提醒，不自动跑。when = 路径前缀；以 /* 结尾 = 只算这个文件夹里直接的文件。每条只挑几个最有代表性的，不求全；改到某一块、心里清楚还碰到哪个探针，照样点名跑。脚本和人都读这一份；守卫 test/test-tiers-guard.test.ts 查每个探针、每个前缀都存在。created 2026-11-10 by Claude Opus 5.5",
 "rules": [
  { "when": ["src/app/keyboard-seen.ts", "src/app/main.ts", "styles.css"], "probes": ["probe-tool-keys.mjs", "probe-mfd.mjs"], "why": "工具栏右上角快捷键小字 + 键名芯片印不印键名：这次打开之后按过实体键盘才显示（只认真按键；笔点过 / 脚本假按键不算；统筹 11-13 D）" },
  { "when": ["src/controller/tool-borrow.ts", "src/editor/editor.ts", "src/app/main.ts", "src/controller/keymap.ts"], "probes": ["probe-temp-tool.mjs"], "why": "快捷键拿起的工具是借的（自由建模）：做完一下 / Esc / 收刀回原来那把、左柱实心 + 蓝框、借用结束不收马后炮、点左柱 / 硬表面照旧一直拿着（统筹 11-13 C）" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/tools/move.ts", "src/editor/tools/draw.ts", "src/editor/tools/tape.ts", "src/editor/increments.ts", "src/editor/tools/mesh-transform.ts", "src/editor/tools/mesh-pull.ts"], "probes": ["probe-lock-last.mjs", "probe-axis-hardsurface.mjs"], "why": "锁是最后一道（统筹 11-13）：每把吃锁的工具锁着往各个方向拖，结果都在锁的线 / 面上" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/objects/move-to.ts", "src/app/selection-actions.ts"], "probes": ["probe-move-to.mjs", "probe-hierarchy-drag.mjs", "probe-clipboard.mjs"], "why": "移到… / 移出一层（第 1 版第三节）：子物体 moveInstance 保 GUID、几何走载荷原位贴、跨种类先问、多份组件说份数" },
  { "when": ["src/scene/world-view.ts", "src/editor/reach-table.ts", "src/editor/edit-marks.ts", "src/editor/stream-provider.ts", "src/minccino/preset/index.ts"], "probes": ["probe-hier-display.mjs", "probe-render-baseline.mjs", "probe-style.mjs"], "why": "层级的显示（第 1 版第 1 件）：这一档只在 relationOf 算；画线 / 画点 / 悬停按 reach-table 那张表；画风自己的线照画、能改的那一层有顶点小圆点、根层不加点" },
  { "when": ["src/controller/axis-constraint.ts", "src/controller/axis-apply.ts", "src/controller/lock-guide.ts", "src/editor/axis-keys.ts", "src/controller/keymap.ts", "src/app/context-menu.ts", "src/editor/born-this-gesture.ts", "src/editor/pick.ts"], "probes": ["probe-axis-freeform.mjs", "probe-axis-hardsurface.mjs", "probe-axis-live-pick.mjs", "probe-lock-last.mjs", "probe-mesh-keymap.mjs", "probe-tool-locks.mjs", "probe-lock-line.mjs", "probe-mfd.mjs"], "why": "轴键（锁的一轮）：手势里 X / Y / Z / N / T 加 Shift → 语法模块 → 工具按自己那一族读；锁线按方向上色；动作外 X = 删除 / 溶解小菜单" },
  { "when": ["src/mesh/hide-plan.ts", "src/scene/hidden.ts", "src/scene/kinds.ts", "src/editor/objects/index.ts"], "probes": ["probe-hide-mesh.mjs", "probe-undo-fuzz.mjs"], "why": "自由建模藏面藏边（H / Shift+H / Alt+H + 右键）、全部显示算上网格体、转回硬表面带上藏面（带不过去先问）、藏面画不上（统筹 11-13）" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/tools/selecting.ts", "src/controller/keymap.ts"], "probes": ["probe-select-linked.mjs"], "why": "L / Shift+L = 选连着的一块 / 拿掉（两种工作台；手势中不响应；空处 = 不变不记一步；硬表面画线只剩 K；user 11-13 批）" },
  { "when": ["src/mesh/ops/make-face.ts", "src/mesh/ops/duplicate.ts"], "probes": ["probe-make-face.mjs", "probe-fill-strip.mjs", "probe-mesh-mirror.mjs"], "why": "造面（Blender F）：五种选法各造一张 / 一条边、自检干净、一步撤销；拒绝说原因不提交；画过的盒子补面不带画、别的面不变；强行对称另一半跟着（统筹插队单 11-13）" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/tools/selecting.ts", "src/editor/tools/select.ts"], "probes": ["probe-select-keep.mjs", "probe-selecting.mjs", "probe-guide-select.mjs"], "why": "替换档单击点中已经选着的 = 选区不变（面 / 子物体 / 参考线同一口径），Shift / Ctrl / 多选档照各自的意思，点空白清空；自由建模的点选 / 框 / 按下三分法（user 11-13，统筹 A）" },
  { "when": ["src/app/session.ts", "src/app-store.ts", "vendor-pkgs/", "package.json"], "probes": ["probe-autosave-resume-race.mjs"], "why": "自动保存撞上回来续推（dirty.pushAll）之后：云端是这次保存的字节，或者待传记号还在（库的计数 + 会话的 pushPending 两层）；同步库 2.2.7 上红，收 2.3.6 变绿（统筹 11-12）" },
  { "when": ["src/format/unit-systems.ts", "src/editor/units.ts", "src/editor/grid-settings.ts", "src/format/migrate/settings.ts"], "probes": ["probe-unit-mm.mjs", "probe-units.mjs", "probe-vcb.mjs", "probe-menu-dropdowns.mjs"], "why": "单位制一张表 + 毫米单位制：打 1 = 1 mm、读数写 mm、10 mm 吸附整数倍、导出重开还在、换回公制模型不变" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/increments.ts", "src/editor/tools/offset.ts", "src/editor/tools/tape.ts", "src/editor/tools/rotate.ts", "src/editor/tools/protractor.ts", "src/editor/tools/arc.ts", "src/editor/tools/rrect.ts", "src/editor/tools/transform.ts", "src/editor/tools/pushpull.ts"], "probes": ["probe-grid-snap.mjs", "probe-pp-snap.mjs", "probe-transform.mjs"], "why": "整格吸附一律取整（gridSnap 唯一入口）：偏移 / 卷尺线模式 / 旋转在适应窗口和缩小 3 倍下结果一样、Shift 不取整、取整得 0 不动（user 11-13「一律取整同意」）" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/gesture-consts.ts", "src/editor/tools/draw.ts", "src/editor/tools/move.ts", "src/editor/tools/offset.ts", "src/editor/tools/transform.ts", "src/editor/tools/rrect.ts", "src/editor/tools/arc.ts", "src/editor/tools/rotate.ts", "src/editor/tools/scale.ts", "src/editor/tools/tape.ts", "src/editor/tools/axes.ts", "src/editor/tape-geom.ts", "src/editor/axes-geom.ts"], "probes": ["probe-gesture-px.mjs"], "why": "手势动没动按屏幕像素、几何只看几何容差：放大时 1 毫米的线 / 圆 / 移动 / 偏移做得成，缩小时拖 2 像素 = 模型不变（user 11-12 做小零件；统筹 B）" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/tools/pushpull.ts", "src/editor/gesture-consts.ts", "src/editor/increments.ts"], "probes": ["probe-pp-snap.mjs"], "why": "推拉开着吸附 = 一律取吸附长度的整数倍、和缩放无关；画小面 → 适应窗口 → 推拉，1 厘米 / 1 毫米吸附、不到半格 = 0 不提交、Shift 不取整（user 11-12 做小零件）" },
  { "when": ["src/controller/typed-input.ts", "src/app/vcb.ts", "src/editor/vcb.ts"], "probes": ["probe-vcb-keys.mjs"], "why": "数值小窗：软键盘每个键（含 cm / mm、空框的点）+ 实体键盘打小数和单位 + 手势中点软键盘（user 11-12）" },
  { "when": ["src/mesh/mirror-ops.ts", "src/editor/mirror-force.ts"], "probes": ["probe-mirror-ask.mjs"], "why": "镜像编辑开着、要改拓扑的入口（选面建组件、选面复制粘贴、删除、右键网格体指令）都先问「关掉镜像，照做 / 取消」；建组件照做 = 关镜像 + 建组件一步（统筹 11-12）" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/editor.ts", "src/editor/history.ts"], "probes": ["probe-doc-revision.mjs", "probe-mirror-ask.mjs"], "why": "文档改动号变 ⟺ 写出去的文件会变（不算桌面态、缩略图、版本串）：22 样动作 + 进出组件、选区、撤销重做纯选区、换工作台、转视角，每样比改动号和存盘字节（统筹 11-12，rev() 拆成 docChanged / viewChanged）" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/grid-state.ts", "src/editor/grid-settings.ts", "src/editor/scale-ref.ts"], "probes": ["probe-settings-dirty.mjs"], "why": "住在文件设置里的网格 / 单位制 / 尺度参考：改了算改过、空闲 30 秒自动保存写了、刷新后值还在；换画风（桌面态）照旧不算（统筹 11-12，存盘忠实度清点第五节）" },
  { "when": ["src/app/session.ts"], "probes": ["probe-autosave-clock.mjs", "probe-hand-busy.mjs", "probe-settings-dirty.mjs"], "why": "存盘那条路的计时：墙上钟往回跳一小时，空闲满 30 秒照常自动保存 / 拍崩溃快照（只往前走的钟，v0.19.52）；一笔当中不存不拍（手上的名册）" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/mode.ts", "src/editor/modes/", "src/paint/board.ts", "src/paint/boards.ts", "src/paint/space-paint.ts", "src/app/paint-workbench.ts", "src/paint/pixel-writes.ts"], "probes": ["probe-lock-matrix.mjs"], "why": "锁上时每个工作台 × 每把会改东西的工具放下成只读工具、工作台照声明；画画那一格锁着时真的笔 / 直接调控制器 / 调试钩子都画不上、撤销栈不长、进不了画画工作台（v0.19.48）" },
  { "when": ["src/paint/boards.ts", "src/paint/board.ts", "src/paint/space-prep.ts", "src/minccino/providers/three/render3.ts", "src/minccino/providers/three/live-image.ts", "src/minccino/providers/three/pbr-shader.ts", "src/editor/stream-provider.ts", "src/minccino/contract/stream.ts", "src/paint/kernel/src/backend/gl/gl-room.ts"], "probes": ["probe-ten-objects.mjs"], "why": "一个文件里 10 个物件各画一张：画板 / 显示图 / 准备 / 图块池 / 显卡上的图（连 2D 图组一起记账）跟着物件个数怎么涨；解码贴图缓存换图 6 次、同一份带图的文件开关 6 次涨不涨（流畅第 14 条，只量）" },
  { "when": ["src/controller/keymap.ts", "src/editor/modes/", "src/editor/editor.ts"], "probes": ["probe-workbench-tools.mjs"], "why": "工作台只发自己的工具（统筹 11-11）：setTool 不换工作台、工具键只按跳转表明着跨（硬表面 / 表面 / 自由建模之间照旧、多一句提示）、画画里工具键不动工作台和撤销栈、按 E 再拖还是画画的笔" },
  { "when": ["src/paint/save.ts", "src/paint/board.ts", "src/app/session.ts", "src/app/paint-workbench.ts", "src/editor/modes/paint.ts", "src/controller/hand-busy.ts"], "probes": ["probe-mid-stroke-save.mjs"], "why": "一笔当中存盘（失焦 / 切后台再 pointercancel / 关页 / 临时家的崩溃快照），存出来的自己一致：落定版本 = 笔之前、合成图逐字节 = 笔之前的整张合成（没有半笔）、文件和快照里就是这份字节、存完接着画核对对上（统筹 11-11）" },
  { "when": ["src/controller/hand-busy.ts", "src/app/session.ts", "src/app/paint-workbench.ts"], "probes": ["probe-hand-busy.mjs"], "why": "一笔当中不自动保存、不拍崩溃快照（手上还有没有一下没收的名册，统筹 11-11）：临时家 / 文件夹图库家各一遍、抬笔后空闲满 30 秒才存、存下来带着这一笔（刷新对字节）" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/surface-assign.ts", "src/editor/modes/surface.ts"], "probes": ["probe-mesh-bucket.mjs"], "why": "油漆桶（表面工作台；W-12 起也管网格体的面）" },
  { "when": ["src/controller/lock-drag.ts", "src/editor/tools/mesh-grab.ts", "src/editor/tools/mesh-transform.ts", "src/editor/tools/mesh-pull.ts"], "probes": ["probe-lock-plane-drag.mjs"], "why": "拖动的位移（锁面跟手，W-13）" },
  { "when": ["src/mesh/", "src/editor/mesh-edits/"], "probes": ["probe-mesh-workbench.mjs", "probe-mesh-bevel.mjs", "probe-mesh-subdivide.mjs", "probe-mesh-knife.mjs", "probe-pool-mesh.mjs"], "why": "网格体内核 / 网格体指令：自由建模的几个代表" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/tools/mesh-"], "probes": ["probe-mesh-handles.mjs", "probe-mesh-pull.mjs", "probe-mesh-transform.mjs", "probe-mesh-knife.mjs", "probe-finish-chip.mjs", "probe-afterthought-ok.mjs"], "why": "自由建模的工具手势" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/param-panel.ts", "src/app/vcb.ts", "src/editor/mesh-edits/", "src/mesh/ops/loopcut.ts"], "probes": ["probe-afterthought-ok.mjs", "probe-vcb.mjs", "probe-axes-to-sel.mjs"], "why": "参数小窗（马后炮、确定、刀和环切的小窗）" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/tools/"], "probes": ["probe-pen.mjs", "probe-touch.mjs", "probe-steps.mjs", "probe-taps.mjs", "probe-finish-chip.mjs"], "why": "工具的手势（笔 / 手指 / 多步）" },
  { "when": ["src/kernel/"], "probes": ["probe-scene.mjs", "probe-lift.mjs", "probe-weld.mjs", "probe-two-sides.mjs"], "why": "硬表面内核" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/repairs/"], "probes": ["probe-repair-panel.mjs", "probe-repair-scope.mjs", "probe-slow-ask.mjs", "probe-cleanup.mjs"], "why": "修复指令" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/objects/", "src/editor/commands/"], "probes": ["probe-objects-merge.mjs", "probe-clipboard.mjs", "probe-nested-preview.mjs", "probe-undo-fuzz.mjs"], "why": "物件层动词 / 菜单指令" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/move/"], "probes": ["probe-move-copy.mjs", "probe-move-grid.mjs", "probe-twin-preview.mjs"], "why": "移动 / 复制" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/modes/"], "probes": ["probe-mesh-workbench.mjs", "probe-workbench-cross.mjs", "probe-reload-mode.mjs", "probe-surface.mjs"], "why": "工作台 / 模式" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/*"], "probes": ["probe-undo-session.mjs", "probe-undo-fuzz.mjs", "probe-clipboard.mjs", "probe-hover.mjs"], "why": "编辑器本体（撤销、剪贴板、悬停拾取）" },
  { "when": ["src/paint/freed.ts", "src/editor/paint-freed.ts", "src/editor/paint-upkeep.ts", "src/editor/history.ts"], "probes": ["bench-freed.mts", "probe-paint-freed.mjs"], "why": "空出来的地方：真的编辑器一步里中途记一次、最后再记一次，撤销 / 重做逐个回去 / 回来，再做一步基线不乱（probe-paint-freed）；记空位花多久（bench-freed，统筹预审第 2 条）：一步删掉 4 万张画过的面，记空位不许比删面本身慢、清单不超过 256、再跑一次没有要改的" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/history.ts", "src/paint/boards.ts", "src/paint/space-paint.ts", "src/editor/last-step.ts"], "probes": ["probe-paint-undo.mjs", "probe-undo-fuzz.mjs"], "why": "撤销：画的每一步进三维的撤销栈（1-8a）+ 编辑器级撤销随机串" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/editor.ts", "src/editor/history.ts", "src/app/session.ts"], "probes": ["probe-step-atomic.mjs"], "why": "一步全有或全无：被拒（护栏 / 物件锁 / 演示锁）= 场景、历史、重做、改动号、画板都不动，状态栏是原因（2026-11-13 a12b）" },
  { "when": ["src/editor/gesture-consts.ts", "src/editor/tools/scale.ts", "src/editor/tools/transform.ts", "src/controller/feel.ts"], "probes": ["probe-transform.mjs"], "why": "移动 / 旋转 / 缩放的手柄（面心柄、角柄、等比）：v0.19.72 手势门槛改按像素时缩放面心柄回归，那时这几个文件没带出这个探针、隔了几版才跑到（统筹 11-13 补）" },
  { "when": ["src/paint/brush-kinds.ts", "src/paint/brush-records.ts", "src/editor/tool-config.ts", "src/app/paint-brushes.ts"], "probes": ["probe-paint-workbench.mjs"], "why": "笔的种类和出厂值：新文件拿哪支笔、旋钮的初值、下拉里的名字；v0.19.69 平涂改名改初值、v0.19.77 默认换草稿笔时这个探针隔了几版才跑到（统筹 11-13 补）" },
  { "when": ["src/paint/space-fill.ts", "src/paint/texel-table.ts", "src/app/paint-workbench.ts", "src/editor/modes/paint.ts"], "probes": ["probe-paint-bucket.mjs"], "why": "油漆桶（2026-11-13）：点一下填满一张面（格数 = 归属表）、邻面不动（公共边半格不算溢出）、撤销一步回去、没排进画布的面不改、拖过三张面三张都填撤销一步全回去" },
  { "when": ["src/app/paint-workbench.ts", "src/app/paint-color.ts", "src/app/paint-sliders.ts", "src/app/paint-brushes.ts", "src/paint/brush-records.ts", "src/editor/modes/paint.ts", "src/editor/mesh-edits/start-paint.ts", "src/app/gestures.ts", "src/paint/space-paint.ts"], "probes": ["probe-paint-workbench.mjs"], "why": "画画工作台（1-7）：开始画、画 / 擦 / 撤 / 重做、吸管、手指转视角不画、一笔当中相机不动、出了工作台笔照旧、存了重开、颜色面板、量；工具条下拉换笔、旋钮按笔记、存了重开拿的还是那支（施工单二十 1b）" },
  { "when": ["src/app/canvas-window.ts", "src/app/ui/image-view.ts", "src/paint/board.ts", "src/paint/boards.ts", "src/app/paint-brushes.ts", "src/paint/brush-records.ts"], "probes": ["probe-canvas-paint.mjs"], "why": "在画布小窗里画（施工单二十一第 2 刀）：笔 / 鼠标画、中键和手指挪、吸管、两块画面来回画撤重做、一笔当中小窗跟着变、锁着画不上" },
  { "when": ["src/app/canvas-window.ts", "src/paint/boards.ts", "src/paint/save.ts", "src/scene/paint.ts", "src/editor/stream-provider.ts", "src/minccino/providers/three/live-image.ts", "src/format/document.ts", "src/app/paint-workbench.ts"], "probes": ["probe-tiled-paint.mjs"], "why": "平铺的画（施工单二十一第 3 刀）：新建、小窗里画、涂到面上重复平铺、模型上不画说原因、撤销重做、存盘再打开（含一笔没画就存的那张）、锁" },
  { "when": ["src/paint/save.ts", "src/paint/boards.ts", "src/paint/kernel/src/backend/ora.ts", "src/paint/kernel/src/backend/ora-stack-xml.ts"], "probes": ["probe-old-blank-paint.mjs"], "why": "老文件（v0.19.60 写的、一笔没画就存的画，分层字节里 weebpaint:id=\"undefined\"）再打开画得上：内核 v0.14.89 读的那一头兜住" },
